DESCRIPTION:Internal hard stop for Hall County 012-47 Drug Screen Kits & Services bid submission.\n\nWhy today (May 26) instead of the May 28 official deadline:\nGeorgia is transitioning to GA@WORK ERP. All suppliers go to READ-ONLY access on and after May 27 2026. The official deadline is May 28 at 2:00 PM ET, but the portal is read-only by then.\n\nMust be submitted via GPR by 5:00 PM ET today, or confirmed alternate submission path with Connie Barnes (cbarnes@hallcounty.org / 770.535.8263) BEFORE May 25.\n\nFolder: BIDS:RESOURCES/HALL COUNTY GA DRUG SCREEN KITS/
